    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 5,
        "sourceEnd": 147,
        "text": "Hi, Ben. Thanks for coming to the review meeting. Let's look at the 'Read to Succeed' program. It ran for six months in three primary schools.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "42e9bfa510143fc587ebf74d273786cfcd2a76c0e58e32fdf8f0b9f7379af3e9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 153,
        "sourceEnd": 265,
        "text": "Sure. I have the final report here. Overall, the results are positive, but there are some issues with resources.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "addb53e83632c7a0e668dc9307449c9de0db84a39cd710dd79de486d2d045fb9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 271,
        "sourceEnd": 336,
        "text": "Right. Let's start with the numbers. How many students took part?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "40172ec25e4c4c38cdf37134dc84c4b2a8ca734ca78efc8a9470e6e26f0adaf5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 342,
        "sourceEnd": 511,
        "text": "We had 240 students in total. 120 in the experimental group and 120 in the control group. The experimental group received 30 minutes of extra reading practice every day.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "f7867077de120bd7cdf4e775f7b6976fb2565b171c59f62f946530cd868c50c1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 517,
        "sourceEnd": 572,
        "text": "And what about the teachers? Did they get any training?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "6a76c39fe07fea53c39b437840105ccf0d1b008d015d906c7c664f394aedde22",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 578,
        "sourceEnd": 694,
        "text": "Yes, but only 15 teachers were trained, and that was just for two days. Some teachers said they needed more support.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "69d856644b4bad5927ea3a190c77d328068d771a49c5acdbd83f0d04ee92ef79",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 700,
        "sourceEnd": 739,
        "text": "I see. So, what were the main findings?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "bcb78d0063dbcb00ddcbf755cef7252cc9d1640400879e26d7673f295b836a10",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 745,
        "sourceEnd": 914,
        "text": "Well, the experimental group improved their reading scores by 20 percent on average, while the control group improved by only 5 percent. That's a significant difference.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "795ca9b90d2e1925e799a34500dc86aabf70367eff25ea7f9788e2706ab0366f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 920,
        "sourceEnd": 971,
        "text": "That's great. But did all students benefit equally?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "205318b8354175ebae961f3f148e21700314505f9f24df35617a44f77fd828a9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 977,
        "sourceEnd": 1118,
        "text": "Not exactly. Students who already had good reading skills improved less. The biggest gains were among students who started with lower scores.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "233ab02d489db93eafa85282573834b87a54bbec2ae6c07216d0c6bb53ce59c0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1124,
        "sourceEnd": 1185,
        "text": "Interesting. Now, about resources. Did you have enough books?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "09457857a4ec89f1ad65e0bba3e8d9cb49148c2ff0b4d48ca2d60b1b02feb122",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1191,
        "sourceEnd": 1338,
        "text": "No, we didn't. We only had 200 books for 240 students. So some students had to share. Also, the books were not very interesting for older students.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "f4d35e3a913875c5400bb01eb99e5df1ec0b758d67993ebd7f5b2f5a8b20c67e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1344,
        "sourceEnd": 1405,
        "text": "That's a problem. What about the time? Was 30 minutes enough?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "d4613bef581a698bd3e1062c4ead231ede38c0a6cf9ac112d9715dfb67b8b0a5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1411,
        "sourceEnd": 1515,
        "text": "Most teachers said 30 minutes was too short. They wanted 45 minutes. But the school day is already full.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "094190a3e4f54a0297657bf02ffa60b14a9ad16549503d62a8e3af3f3fa30139",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1521,
        "sourceEnd": 1576,
        "text": "So, if we run the program again, what should we change?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "68fd29fe99e09df463df8e931411ff37b65a65edcf0be6af36acb9b687c2afc5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1582,
        "sourceEnd": 1754,
        "text": "If we have more funding, we should buy more books and train more teachers. Also, we could make the reading time longer, but only if we can find extra time in the timetable.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "aaf6e0afbe3e318871f3136b050c43021f546bc2cf0ab4bd526a9856317cd98d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1760,
        "sourceEnd": 1837,
        "text": "OK. And how about the assessment? Did you use the same test before and after?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "153d14c1a03491b432e26a6b34c75c0b8f57685388ba5197cf8f2cc58d9e90fd",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1843,
        "sourceEnd": 1947,
        "text": "Yes, we used the same reading test. But some teachers said the test was too easy for the older students.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "ec85c52bd5cfa21834e083c2eee86a8475c73d5e1bdec6bdf5d404161232b588",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1953,
        "sourceEnd": 2016,
        "text": "I see. So, overall, would you recommend continuing the program?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "762536d7d0cc81635b83c882384e403993c82ec0e0f5ced470365a778c6661a9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 2022,
        "sourceEnd": 2143,
        "text": "Yes, definitely. But we need to fix the resource problems first. If we don't, the results might not be as good next time.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "5272b286ca8fc91b235faf52651fe8ac79195a4de03309b4f84732abe1c95247",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 2149,
        "sourceEnd": 2224,
        "text": "Agreed. Let's write a summary report and suggest some changes. Thanks, Ben.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "3f171a45da374d7a263794d7879f7a960001e507c590dc83fe53e7056fcba1b2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 2230,
        "sourceEnd": 2245,
        "text": "You're welcome.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "124eb273f9a0a470e3d6930f97e1402f311a753dc9d656b1ef17ef12367caffa",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      }
    ]
  },
